[{"id":"khala-15-13-4","words":["verb:khala"],"options":[{"bs":"prošao je","en":"has passed"},{"bs":"osamio se","en":"he/it was alone"},{"bs":"slobodan je","en":"he/it is free"},{"bs":"osamili su se","en":"they were alone"}],"ref":"15:13","answerWord":"خَلَتْ","answerSound":"audio/cd35e25257969e69444d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"They believe not therein, though the example of the men of old hath gone before.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"proći, osamiti se","en":"to pass away, to be alone"},"passage":["لَا","يُؤْمِنُونَ","بِهِۦ","وَقَدْ","خَلَتْ","سُنَّةُ","ٱلْأَوَّلِينَ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"خَلا"}},{"id":"khala-2-14-7","words":["verb:khala"],"options":[{"bs":"osamili su se","en":"they were alone"},{"bs":"prošla je","en":"she/it passed away"},{"bs":"slobodan je","en":"he/it is free"},{"bs":"osamio se","en":"he/it was alone"}],"ref":"2:14","answerWord":"خَلَوْا۟","answerSound":"audio/47578b7dd3bd7f1c43f0.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when they fall in with those who believe, they say: We believe; but when they go apart to their devils they declare: Lo! we are with you; verily we did but mock.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"proći, osamiti se","en":"to pass away, to be alone"},"passage":["وَإِذَا","لَقُوا۟","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","قَالُوٓا۟","ءَامَنَّا","وَإِذَا","خَلَوْا۟","إِلَىٰ","شَيَٰطِينِهِمْ","قَالُوٓا۟","إِنَّا","مَعَكُمْ","إِنَّمَا","نَحْنُ","مُسْتَهْزِءُونَ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"خَلا"}},{"id":"khala-2-76-7","words":["verb:khala"],"options":[{"bs":"osamio se","en":"he/it was alone"},{"bs":"slobodan je","en":"he/it is free"},{"bs":"prošla je","en":"she/it passed away"},{"bs":"osamili su se","en":"they were alone"}],"ref":"2:76","answerWord":"خَلَا","answerSound":"audio/404bfb3e0ce87088a336.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when they fall in with those who believe, they say: We believe. But when they go apart one with another they say: Prate ye to them of that which Allah hath disclosed to you that they may contend with you before your Lord concerning it? Have ye then no sense?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"proći, osamiti se","en":"to pass away, to be alone"},"passage":["وَإِذَا","لَقُوا۟","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","قَالُوٓا۟","ءَامَنَّا","وَإِذَا","خَلَا","بَعْضُهُمْ","إِلَىٰ","بَعْضٍ","قَالُوٓا۟","أَتُحَدِّثُونَهُم","بِمَا","فَتَحَ","ٱللَّهُ","عَلَيْكُمْ","لِيُحَآجُّوكُم","بِهِۦ","عِندَ","رَبِّكُمْ","أَفَلَا","تَعْقِلُونَ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"خَلا"}},{"id":"khala-46-17-9","words":["verb:khala"],"options":[{"bs":"prošla je","en":"she/it passed away"},{"bs":"slobodan je","en":"he/it is free"},{"bs":"osamili su se","en":"they were alone"},{"bs":"osamio se","en":"he/it was alone"}],"ref":"46:17","answerWord":"خَلَتِ","answerSound":"audio/711302f19ce500898d75.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And whoso saith unto his parents: Fie upon you both! Do ye threaten me that I shall be brought forth (again) when generations before me have passed away? And they twain cry unto Allah for help (and say): Woe unto thee! Believe! Lo! the promise of Allah is true. But he saith: This is naught save fables of the men of old:","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"proći, osamiti se","en":"to pass away, to be alone"},"passage":["وَٱلَّذِى","قَالَ","لِوَٰلِدَيْهِ","أُفٍّ","لَّكُمَآ","أَتَعِدَانِنِىٓ","أَنْ","أُخْرَجَ","وَقَدْ","خَلَتِ","ٱلْقُرُونُ","مِن","قَبْلِى","وَهُمَا","يَسْتَغِيثَانِ","ٱللَّهَ","وَيْلَكَ","ءَامِنْ","إِنَّ","وَعْدَ","ٱللَّهِ","حَقٌّ","فَيَقُولُ","مَا","هَٰذَآ","إِلَّآ","أَسَٰطِيرُ","ٱلْأَوَّلِينَ"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"خَلا"}},{"id":"khala-12-9-5","words":["verb:khala"],"options":[{"bs":"slobodan je","en":"he/it is free"},{"bs":"osamili su se","en":"they were alone"},{"bs":"osamio se","en":"he/it was alone"},{"bs":"prošla je","en":"she/it passed away"}],"ref":"12:9","answerWord":"يَخْلُ","answerSound":"audio/44c8a5eebb98514537ec.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"(One said): Kill Joseph or cast him to some (other) land, so that your father's favour may be all for you, and (that) ye may afterward be righteous folk.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"proći, osamiti se","en":"to pass away, to be alone"},"passage":["ٱقْتُلُوا۟","يُوسُفَ","أَوِ","ٱطْرَحُوهُ","أَرْضًا","يَخْلُ","لَكُمْ","وَجْهُ","أَبِيكُمْ","وَتَكُونُوا۟","مِنۢ","بَعْدِهِۦ","قَوْمًا","صَٰلِحِينَ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"خَلا"}}]